# Tudo Sobre Cannabis — layout reference

When changing the presentation layer of the web app, treat
`replit-layout-provisorio/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` as the visual source of truth and
`replit-layout-provisorio/src/` as implementation reference.

- Preserve editorial content, Markdown sources, existing routes, pipelines and data shapes.
- Use Fraunces for editorial titles, DM Sans for reading/interface and DM Mono for metadata.
- Use the paper, dark forest, lime and clay tokens from the design system.
- Do not add a metrics strip to the hero.
- Keep focus styles, responsive behavior and existing semantic structure intact.